{v:'VER',what:'partyp1, his verdict on the style medals (keep all of them, Halo style): each medal is a metal emblem of its own in a row at the left edge, the newest popping in large and settling, its name and figure on a plate under the newest only, clear of the HUD panels; the old text plates at the cursor are gone; a medal is one line in the feed',
 run:function(){
   if(!(window.__state&&window.__endRaid&&window.__runPrep)) return 'SKIP: no raid here';
